##   ├ Reference                                             {{{2
# Contexts:
#     R = Root Window                 rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr
#     W = Application Window          rIrrrr<---------^rrrrr
#     F = Frame Corners               rrrrrr[13TTTT642]rrrrr
#     S = Frame Sides                 rIrrrr[wwwwwwwww]rrrrr
#     T = Title Bar                   rrrrrr[wwwwwwwww]rrrrr
#     I = Icon                        rIrrrrv_________>rrrrr
#                                     rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr
#
#     Numbers are buttons: [1 3 5 7 9  TTTTT  0 8 6 4 2]
#
#   shift       Shift_L (0x32),  Shift_R (0x3e)
#   lock        Caps_Lock (0x42)
#   control     Control_L (0x25),  Control_R (0x69)
#   mod1        Alt_L (0x40),  Alt_R (0x6c),  Meta_L (0xcd)
#   mod2        Num_Lock (0x4d)
#   mod3
#   mod4        Super_L (0x85),  Super_R (0x86), switch (0xcb)
#
# Modifiers: (A)ny, (C)ontrol, (S)hift, (M)eta, (N)othing
#
# Format: Key <X>  <Context> <Modifier> <Action>
#         Mouse <X> <Context> <Modifier> <Action>
#                                                            }}}2
##   ├ Keyboard                                              {{{2
##   │ ├ App Shortcuts                                       {{{3
Silent Key L A 4 Exec exec xscreensaver-command --lock
Silent Key S A 4 Exec flameshot gui
Silent Key Print A A Exec flameshot screen
Silent Key T A 4 Exec exec $[infostore.terminal] -1
Silent Key XF86Calculator A N Exec exec $[infostore.calculator]
Silent Key W A 4 Exec exec firefox
Silent Key E A 4 Exec exec $[infostore.filemanager]
Silent Key R A 4 Exec exec rofi -show drun
#Silent Key . A 14 Exec exec kcharselect
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ Window controls                                     {{{3
Silent Key A A 4 ThisWindow Stick Toggle
Silent Key Q A S4 ThisWindow Delete
Silent Key k A 4 Pick Destroy
Silent Key T WTFS S4 ToggleTitle
Silent Key I A 4 Exec exec FvwmCommand FvwmIdent
Silent Key S WFST S4 ThisWindow IconifyWindow
Silent Key D A 4 ShowDesktop "prev RestoreDesktop"
Silent Key Tab A M  Exec exec $[FVWM_USERDIR]/bin/fvwm-alttab
Silent Key Tab A SM Exec exec $[FVWM_USERDIR]/bin/fvwm-alttab --reverse
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ FVWM controls                                       {{{3
IgnoreModifiers L25
Silent Key F1 A M Menu MenuFvwmRoot
Silent Key Escape A 4 Restart

Silent Key slash A 4 Exec exec $[FVWM_USERDIR]/bin/fvwm-keys

Silent Key F A 4 FullscreenToggle
Silent Key F W S4 Maximize 100 100 ewmhiwa
Silent Key A A S4 Exec exec $[FVWM_USERDIR]/bin/shelf-panel --toggle-side
Silent Key space A 4 TileToggle
Silent Key space A S4 TileToggleFloating
Silent Key Return A C4 TileSetMaster
Silent Key bracketleft A C4 TileMasterNarrower
Silent Key bracketright A C4 TileMasterWider

# Window Buttons: [1 3 5 7 9  TTTTT  0 8 6 4 2]
#   1 - Open the WindowOps menu.
#   2 - Close on single click, Destory on double click.
#   4 - Maximize (right/middle button will only maximize vertical/horizontal)
#   6 - Iconify (minimize)
Mouse 1 1 A Menu MenuWindowOps Delete
Mouse 1 2 A Delete
Mouse 1 4 A Maximize 100 100
Mouse 2 4 A Maximize 0 100
Mouse 3 4 A Maximize 100 0
Mouse 1 6 A ThisWindow IconifyWindow
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ Audio                                               {{{3
Silent Key XF86AudioRaiseVolume A A Exec exec "wpctl set-volume $[infostore.media_output] 2%+"
Silent Key XF86AudioLowerVolume A A Exec exec "wpctl set-volume $[infostore.media_output] 2%-"
#Silent Key XF86AudioMute A A Exec exec "wpctl set-mute @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ toggle"
Silent Key Pause A A Exec exec /home/deer/.scripts/volume_brightness.sh play_pause
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ Window tiling                                       {{{3
Key KP_Left WTSF 1 TileLeft
Key KP_Right WTSF 1 TileRight
Key KP_Up WTSF 1 TileTop
Key KP_Down WTSF 1 TileBottom
Key KP_Home WTSF 1 TileTopLeft
Key KP_Prior WTSF 1 TileTopRight
Key KP_End WTSF 1 TileBottomLeft
Key KP_Next WTSF 1 TileBottomRight
Key KP_Begin WTSF 1 TileFull
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ Move window to page (numpad, spatial)               {{{3
# Numpad layout matches the 3x3 page grid: KP_7/8/9 top row, KP_4/5/6 mid,
# KP_1/2/3 bottom row.
Silent Key KP_Home  WTSF 4 MoveToPage 0 0
Silent Key KP_Up    WTSF 4 MoveToPage 1 0
Silent Key KP_Prior WTSF 4 MoveToPage 2 0
Silent Key KP_Left  WTSF 4 MoveToPage 0 1
Silent Key KP_Begin WTSF 4 MoveToPage 1 1
Silent Key KP_Right WTSF 4 MoveToPage 2 1
Silent Key KP_End   WTSF 4 MoveToPage 0 2
Silent Key KP_Down  WTSF 4 MoveToPage 1 2
Silent Key KP_Next  WTSF 4 MoveToPage 2 2
##                                                           }}}3
##   │ ├ Desktop Switching                                   {{{3
Silent Key 1 A 4 PagerNavigate 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4 PagerNavigate 1 0
Silent Key 3 A 4 PagerNavigate 2 0
Silent Key 4 A 4 PagerNavigate 0 1
Silent Key 5 A 4 PagerNavigate 1 1
Silent Key 6 A 4 PagerNavigate 2 1
Silent Key 7 A 4 PagerNavigate 0 2
Silent Key 8 A 4 PagerNavigate 1 2
Silent Key 9 A 4 PagerNavigate 2 2

# Move window to page (mirrors the Super+<n> page numbering above)
Silent Key 1 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 0 0
Silent Key 2 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 1 0
Silent Key 3 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 2 0
Silent Key 4 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 0 1
Silent Key 5 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 1 1
Silent Key 6 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 2 1
Silent Key 7 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 0 2
Silent Key 8 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 1 2
Silent Key 9 WTSF S4 MoveToPage 2 2

# Move window one page in a direction
Silent Key Right WTSF S4 MoveToPage wrapx wrapy +1p 0p
Silent Key Left  WTSF S4 MoveToPage wrapx wrapy -1p 0p
Silent Key Up    WTSF S4 MoveToPage wrapx wrapy 0p -1p
Silent Key Down  WTSF S4 MoveToPage wrapx wrapy 0p +1p

# Tab walks all 9 pages in reading order; arrows move on the grid
Silent Key Tab A S4 PagerNavigateSeq -1
Silent Key Tab A 4  PagerNavigateSeq +1
Silent Key Tab A C4  PagerNavigate 0p +1p
Silent Key Tab A SC4 PagerNavigate 0p -1p
Silent Key Right A 4 PagerNavigate +1p 0p
Silent Key Left A 4  PagerNavigate -1p 0p
Silent Key Up A 4    PagerNavigate 0p -1p
Silent Key Down A 4  PagerNavigate 0p +1p
Silent Key Prior A 4 PagerNavigate 0p -1p
Silent Key Next A 4  PagerNavigate 0p +1p

Silent Key grave A 4 ToggleEdgeScroll

##                                                           }}}3
